<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK OCT DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.21 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK OCT DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.21 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Friday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 6.21 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Oct 22			5,700</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Oct		6,469</p>
<p> Average reserves to Oct 17			   6,689</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,207</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 245</p>
